  "2026-11-10T05:34:49.898Z",pi-web305-1107,"Re-review round 3 on PR 305 at 90d41c7. Five unresolved threads. Rule for the blocking thread: a storage access check must bind physical workspace and tracker identities, pin the queued operation to that storage, and compare both identities again before releasing data. Rule for packed Markdown: compare the pack inventory, not manifest entries. Rule for fences: CommonMark closing length, character and whitespace, including unclosed fences to EOF. Rule for destinations: malformed percent-encoding must not abort acceptance. Rule for revision checks: an unresolvable Git object is not a missing link. Fixing every instance of those rules."
